<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu sees 50 pct profit rise in 97/98.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu sees 50 pct profit rise in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd said on Monday it expects parent current profit of 120 billion yen in the 1997/98 business year, starting on April 1, up 50 percent from 80 billion yen forecast for 1996/97.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not yet finalised our forecast for the next business year, but this is what we basically expect,&quot; a company spokesman said on the 1997/98 figure.</p>
<p>The expected sharp improvement in earnings is because of robust demand for computer networks for corporate clients.</p>
</text>
